### Test Multiple Users Locations Endpoint
### Bu faylni REST Client extension bilan ishlatish mumkin

### 1. Test with date only (all active users)
POST http://localhost:5084/api/locations/multiple_users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_ids": null,
  "branch_guid": null,
  "date": "2026-01-31",
  "start_hour": null,
  "end_hour": null,
  "limit": 100
}

### 2. Test with specific user_ids
POST http://localhost:5084/api/locations/multiple_users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_ids": [5475, 5476],
  "branch_guid": null,
  "date": "2026-01-31",
  "start_hour": null,
  "end_hour": null,
  "limit": 100
}

### 3. Test with time filters
POST http://localhost:5084/api/locations/multiple_users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_ids": null,
  "branch_guid": null,
  "date": "2026-01-31",
  "start_hour": "09:00",
  "end_hour": "18:00",
  "limit": 100
}

### 4. Test with specific user_ids and time filter
POST http://localhost:5084/api/locations/multiple_users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_ids": [5475],
  "branch_guid": null,
  "date": "2026-01-31",
  "start_hour": "09:00",
  "end_hour": "18:00",
  "limit": 50
}

